1
00:00:00,944 --> 00:00:05,114
All right. Leonard went to the office.

2
00:00:09,494 --> 00:00:11,664
(Leonard:)What is...? No, not like that.

3
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,580
Just "Leonard went to the office."

4
00:00:13,749 --> 00:00:17,129
Would have worked better if you
told me you were going to the office.

5
00:00:17,294 --> 00:00:18,504
(Leonard:)I'm going to the office.

6
00:00:19,379 --> 00:00:21,259
See, why don't I believe you?

7
00:00:24,259 --> 00:00:26,469
[MUSIC PLAYING ON TV]

8
00:00:26,637 --> 00:00:29,677
- I'm going out for a while.
- Okay.

9
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:35,310
[DOOR CLOSES]

10
00:00:39,066 --> 00:00:41,856
Doesn't anyone wanna know
where he's going?

11
00:00:43,695 --> 00:00:45,195
(Penny:)Okay, where is he going?

12
00:00:45,364 --> 00:01:03,024
Leonard is going to the office.

